  "bodyHash": "tOylwSNxoRQ=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通用附魔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扩展了Minecraft的附魔系统，让附魔能够作用于更多物品，移除了不必要的兼容性限制，并沿途改进了多个原版附魔。✨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为什么只有剑才能享受乐趣？将</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">应用于三叉戟🔱，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">应用于弩🏹，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">应用于斧头🪓，或者将保护附魔应用于动物盔甲🛡️。本模组开启了无数新的组合，同时保持原版游戏体验。⚔️</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了扩展兼容性外，多个附魔还获得了实用的生活质量改进。</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">真正变得无限♾️，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">时运</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">奖励额外经验💎，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变得更加有效🎯，等等。每项更改都可以单独配置⚙️，让您创建最适合您世界的附魔系统。✨</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多武器更多附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">斧、三叉戟、锤、弓、弩、盾牌和其他装备可以接受许多以前不可用的现有附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扩展的远程战斗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在弓上使用</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速装填</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，或在弩上使用</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">力量</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冲击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰附加</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">增强的三叉戟和锤：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将附魔如</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">击退</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">破盾</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">等应用于三叉戟和锤，创造出强大的新武器组合。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔动物盔甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">马铠、狼铠和鹦鹉螺盔甲可以受益于许多盔甲附魔，包括</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">摔落保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰霜行者</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灵魂疾行</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">荆棘</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更少的附魔限制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流行的组合如</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">经验修补</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">默认兼容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可选伤害附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">配置</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">破盾</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一起工作，而不是相互排斥。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可选保护附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">允许</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">爆炸保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">弹射物保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">结合在同一装备上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">改进的原版附魔：</span></strong> <em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">不再需要备用箭矢，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">时运</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提升经验掉落，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">摔落保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防止耕地被踩踏，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">受益于移除的弹射物免疫。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每项兼容性更改和附魔调整都可以通过数据包单独启用、禁用或完全自定义。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持，可以直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（需要在Fabric上安装</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，作者</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，根据配置类型命名为</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。并非所有模组都存在所有类型的配置。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组附带多个可选数据包，用于扩展现有附魔可应用于哪些物品，并启用新的附魔组合。每个数据包专注于特定的物品组或附魔组，并且可以独立控制。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在创建世界时，可以从</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">数据包</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">界面启用或禁用这些数据包，或者在现有世界和多人服务器中使用</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">/datapack</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">命令。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">详细的文档、所有包含的数据包的完整参考，以及本模组提供的额外数据包功能信息，可以在GitHub上的</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">中找到。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-ai-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/skeletonaifix/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-finder\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/deathfinder/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-shroomcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaves-be-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stylisheffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
